<title>USA: Enzo genetic antisense Euro patent upheld.</title>
<headline>Enzo genetic antisense Euro patent upheld.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGDALE, N.Y. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enzo Biochem Inc said on Thursday that the Opposition Division of the European Patent Office upheld the company's patent covering genetic antisense.</p>
<p>Enzo said the Opposition Division upheld the patent against challenges from Calgene Inc and Unilever Plc.</p>
<p>The patent covers a technology that makes it possible to regulate the function of any gene in any cell.</p>
</text>
